                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} V(\mathcal{F})
              as a union of closed subsets. Therefore now the assumption that
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi V
