              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Spec%28Z%29"} Spec(Z)
            %p
              The
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/prime+ideals"} prime ideals
              of the ring of integers are
            %ol
              %li
                %p
                  the ideals
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
