          %h2#InTermsOfGaloisConnections In terms of Galois connections
          %p
            We now discuss how all of the above constructions and statements, and a bit more, follows immediately as a special case of the general theory of what is called
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Galois+connections"} Galois connections
            or
            = succeed "." do
              %em
